# Audit trail (Phase 4).
# Runtime artifact, and it is sensitive: a record holds the input telemetry, the
# raw model output and the operator names attached to each decision. It is also
# append-only by design, so a record committed by accident cannot be edited out
# of the working tree afterwards — only the whole file removed.
sentinel/backend/data/audit/
sentinel/backend/data/chroma_db/
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm





